      "subject": "VibraEngineer — purpose-built for mechanical & civil engineers",
      "body_template": "Hi {{name}},\n\nIf you work with rotating machinery, structural dynamics, or field vibration measurements, this one's for you.\n\n**VibraEngineer** is the only SaaS platform built specifically for engineering vibration analysis:\n\n📡 **Multi-Source Data Ingestion** — Pull data from field sensors, accelerometers, FFT analyzers, and simulation outputs. CSV, JSON, or API — we speak all formats.\n\n📉 **Frequency Domain Analysis** — Automated FFT, PSD, spectrograms, and order tracking. No more wrestling with MATLAB scripts for basic analysis.\n\n🔍 **Anomaly Detection** — ML-powered pattern recognition flags unusual vibration signatures. Early warning for bearing wear, imbalance, misalignment, and resonance.\n\n📋 **Report Generation** — Export professional vibration analysis reports with your branding. Ready for client delivery or regulatory submission.\n\nSee it in action:\n👉 [VibraEngineer Demo](https://vibraengineer.mifeco.com/demo)\n\nHave a specific data set you'd like us to analyze? Reply and upload it — we'll run a free sample analysis.\n\nBest,\nThe MIFECO Team",
