      "day": 10,
      "subject": "How teams use MIFECO SaaS — real workflows, real results",
      "body_template": "Hi {{name}},\n\nStill evaluating? Here's how teams are using MIFECO tools in the real world:\n\n**🏗️ Engineering Firm (50 engineers)**\nUses Project Hypatia Pro to manage 12 concurrent projects. Automated risk tracking caught 3 schedule conflicts in the first week. Saved $40K in potential rework costs in month one.\n\n**📊 Growing Tech Company (20 PMs)**\nDeployed PM Accelerator as a lightweight PMO for their software teams. Reduced status meeting time by 60% — all reporting is now automated and consumed async.\n\n**🔧 Mechanical Engineering Consultancy (8 analysts)**\nUses VibraEngineer for field vibration measurements. Cut analysis time per project from 2 days to 3 hours. Now takes on 3x more projects without hiring.\n\n**The common thread:** Each team adopted one product first, then expanded once they saw results.\n\n👉 [Book a No-Pressure Discovery Call](https://mifeco.com/consult)\n\nWe'll help you figure out which tool (or combination) fits your team best. No pitch, just practical advice.\n\nBest,\nThe MIFECO Team",
