      "body_template": "Hi {{name}},\n\nI know pricing matters, so let's be upfront.\n\n**Project Hypatia Pro**\n• Team: $49/user/month (min 5 users)\n• Business: $39/user/month (min 20 users)\n• Enterprise: Custom pricing with dedicated support\n\n**PM Accelerator**\n• Starter: $19/user/month (up to 10 users)\n• Growth: $14/user/month (up to 50 users)\n• Unlimited: $9/user/month (50+ users)\n\n**VibraEngineer**\n• Analyst: $79/user/month (individual)\n• Team: $59/user/month (2-10 users)\n• Enterprise: Custom pricing with API access & on-prem option\n\nAll plans include:\n✅ 14-day free trial (no credit card)\n✅ Onboarding assistance\n✅ Email & chat support\n✅ Regular feature updates\n\n👉 [Start Your Free Trial](https://mifeco.com/trial)\n\nOr if you have questions about which plan fits your team, just reply — I'll help you figure it out.\n\nBest,\nThe MIFECO Team",
