      "body_template": "Hi {{name}},\n\nThis is the last email in this series, and I want to make sure you have everything you need to make a decision.\n\nHere's where you can go from here:\n\n**1. Ready to try?**\nStart a free 14-day trial of any product — no credit card needed.\n👉 [Start Free Trial](https://mifeco.com/trial)\n\n**2. Want to see it first?**\nBook a 20-minute personalized demo. We'll focus on your specific use case.\n👉 [Book a Demo](https://mifeco.com/demo)\n\n**3. Still comparing options?**\nReply to this email and tell me about your team's biggest challenge. I'll send back a tailored recommendation within 24 hours.\n\n**4. Not the right time?**\nNo problem at all. You'll stay on our list for product updates and new features — no spam, just the useful stuff.\n\nWhichever path you choose, I'm glad we connected. The fact that you made it through all 7 emails tells me you're serious about finding the right tools for your team — and that's exactly who we build for.\n\nAll the best,\nThe MIFECO Team\n\nP.S. — Every MIFECO product comes with a 14-day free trial and onboarding support. There's zero risk in giving it a shot.",
